[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2571632917","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99966#issuecomment-2571632917","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99966","id":2571632917,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZSAEV","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-05T13:47:49Z","updated_at":"2025-01-05T13:48:03Z","body":"It would be nice if resources were unfolding when matched. It can be not obvious when you see a matched Resource that you need to unfold it. Though it seems to be general problem with categories, so it could be improved later 🤔 Resources add lots of nesting though, so finding matched property is more difficult.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2571632917/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2572923730","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99966#issuecomment-2572923730","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99966","id":2572923730,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZW7NS","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-06T11:31:50Z","updated_at":"2025-01-06T11:31:50Z","body":"> It would be nice if resources were unfolding when matched. It can be not obvious when you see a matched Resource that you need to unfold it.\r\n\r\nI agree, that sounds to me like if I'm searching for a property that is in a sub-resource, I'd want it highlighted visibly, so the sub-resource should be unfolded.\r\n\r\nBut I see a potential problem if we try to implement this: it would lead to a lot of unnecessary unfolding of sub-resources with partial matches when starting to type a query. So it might need a debounce timer but that might feel unresponsive. And may still lead to unwanted unfolding if searching e.g. a property / substring that matches both main node and sub-resource property names (e.g. `script`).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2572923730/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2573030214","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99966#issuecomment-2573030214","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99966","id":2573030214,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZXVNG","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-06T12:38:49Z","updated_at":"2025-01-06T12:38:49Z","body":"> So it might need a debounce timer\r\n\r\n#99812\r\n\r\n> it would lead to a lot of unnecessary unfolding of sub-resources\r\n\r\nWe could make them unfold temporarily.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2573030214/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2573356028","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99966#issuecomment-2573356028","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99966","id":2573356028,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZYkv8","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-06T15:33:14Z","updated_at":"2025-01-06T15:33:14Z","body":"I agree that unfolding sections that contain the searched words would be ideal, but I think this should be its own PR, since it should also be implemented for categories as well.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2573356028/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2573999668","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99966#issuecomment-2573999668","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99966","id":2573999668,"node